# Normalise line endings so a Windows checkout still produces a Linux-runnable
# container. A CRLF shebang makes `start.sh` fail with "bad interpreter" on
# Railway, so shell scripts are pinned to LF regardless of core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
